    "title": "Death notices: Sept. 17, 2025 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago\n• CARL (WAYNE) WATSON, 83, Chehalis, died Sept. 5 at his residence. A celebration of life will be held at 2 p.m. Saturday, Sept. 27, at the Chehalis Four Square Church. Arrangements are under the care of Cattermole Funeral Home.\n• CARL “CORK” PETER KARBOSKI, 91, Chehalis, died Sept. 12 at his residence in Dryad. Arrangements are under the care of Funeral Alternatives of Washington.\n• DANIEL W. STUEVE, 62, Chehalis, died Sept. 11 at Providence St. Peter Hospital. A celebration of life will be held at a later date. Arrangements are under the care of Newell-Hoerling’s Mortuary.",
